{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_00.gif?t=1748623410\" />\u25a0 Join the campaign to liberate the nation of Aldin! Engage in countless hours of decisive tactical challenges and shape the fate of the rebellion!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_01.gif?t=1748623410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Unleash \u201cBurst Techs\u201d to enhance your abilities, and utilize them at opportune moments to shift the battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Strategically manipulate both allies and enemy positions, to dominate key points of engagement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_02.gif?t=1748623410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Explore a variety of maps, gather resources, and experience events in a JRPG-inspired free-roaming mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Encounter diverse NPCs, trade, and embark on exciting quests! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_03.gif?t=1748623410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Navigate intricate character arcs, manage complex relationships, and make pivotal decisions that will shape the Resistance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Build your parties and customize their skill sets to create the synergy required to overcome a wide range of victory conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 With over 40 jobs, and countless skill combinations, customize your characters for limitless strategic possibilities! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_04.gif?t=1748623410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Travel through a multitude of regions, each with unique maps and environmental conditions that challenge your adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Manage resources and upgrades in the Returners' encampment to bolster your forces, support allies, and expand your influence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2127730?t=1748623410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748623410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/6190337ecf3c71d1a96b18aa54c5d7a4c2d680a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748623410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/6190337ecf3c71d1a96b18aa54c5d7a4c2d680a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748623410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_00.gif?t=1748623410\" />\u25a0 Join the campaign to liberate the nation of Aldin! Engage in countless hours of decisive tactical challenges and shape the fate of the rebellion!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_01.gif?t=1748623410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Unleash \u201cBurst Techs\u201d to enhance your abilities, and utilize them at opportune moments to shift the battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Strategically manipulate both allies and enemy positions, to dominate key points of engagement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_02.gif?t=1748623410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Explore a variety of maps, gather resources, and experience events in a JRPG-inspired free-roaming mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Encounter diverse NPCs, trade, and embark on exciting quests! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_03.gif?t=1748623410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Navigate intricate character arcs, manage complex relationships, and make pivotal decisions that will shape the Resistance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Build your parties and customize their skill sets to create the synergy required to overcome a wide range of victory conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 With over 40 jobs, and countless skill combinations, customize your characters for limitless strategic possibilities! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/TR_desc_04.gif?t=1748623410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Travel through a multitude of regions, each with unique maps and environmental conditions that challenge your adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Manage resources and upgrades in the Returners' encampment to bolster your forces, support allies, and expand your influence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Triple Tech Arts"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/8a51745fc8324e53f9c086ab7c8ebf165b73f66b/header.jpg?t=